// VabaxOS (ADR-0027): a copy of the system before packages are installed,
// so an update that breaks something can be undone ("Ripristino del
// sistema"). At most one an hour; never in the live system; never on an
// almost full disk. The update goes on even if the copy fails.
DPkg::Pre-Install-Pkgs { "/usr/lib/vabaxos/restore/helper before-install || true"; };
